    "sections": {
        "description": "Classic Plumbing Services is a clean, modern, and highly functional free WordPress theme designed for plumbing professionals and service-based businesses. Whether you're a new company or an established contractor, this theme provides a strong foundation to showcase your services and build a credible online presence. Featuring a mobile-responsive layout, SEO-friendly structure, and easy customization options, it allows you to present your expertise without writing any code. Use it to highlight your team, share client testimonials, post blog updates, and guide visitors to book your services. Designed for performance and versatility, the theme includes essential elements like service listings, contact forms, and calls-to-action—all aimed at converting visitors into customers. It’s also compatible with popular plugins like Elementor and Contact Form 7, ensuring your site is both fast and easy to expand. Whether you're focusing on local services or looking to grow online, Classic Plumbing Services provides the tools to create a professional and trustworthy digital presence for free."
    },
